{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party Me is a party-based adventure, visual novel, a little bit roguelite type game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of the descendants of monsters, build relationships, and help rebuild a world that has lost all hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874620/extras/b66cdf8a2e1e62730799b8589c4d9abc.avif?t=1765426454\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by the Demon King, monsters, and enemies far too powerful for humanity to face, there was still hope: even they age and need heirs, for they are mortal beings. The heroes take in and raise their offspring, forming new parties in search of a chance to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-based game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874620/extras/7ffed0d9cb24ce6a0197501cdb0d1d1c.avif?t=1765426454\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as you need companions, so do they \u2014 together, you\u2019ll endure hardships, overcome threats, and share in the triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874620/extras/ca6a703875e98df5d5e80fdc281b1561.avif?t=1765426454\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, resisting the urge to smash your keyboard is part of the challenge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874620?t=1765426454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874620?t=1765426454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874620/5e98e3d3489d3a5be64e340611fb53cd51e00b69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765426454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874620/5e98e3d3489d3a5be64e340611fb53cd51e00b69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765426454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"NSFW"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party Me is a party-based adventure, visual novel, a little bit roguelite type game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of the descendants of monsters, build relationships, and help rebuild a world that has lost all hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874620/extras/b66cdf8a2e1e62730799b8589c4d9abc.avif?t=1765426454\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by the Demon King, monsters, and enemies far too powerful for humanity to face, there was still hope: even they age and need heirs, for they are mortal beings. The heroes take in and raise their offspring, forming new parties in search of a chance to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-based game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874620/extras/7ffed0d9cb24ce6a0197501cdb0d1d1c.avif?t=1765426454\" width=800 height=450 /></span><